Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: No new data for today situation thus assessment with older data and data for Europe.
Production volume: 10 TWh from power plants and 0 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_db52443d-874d-336f-b7a6-5562eb9bc8a0.xml</text>
